# Force LF for every text file, in the index and on checkout.
#
# GitHub's Windows runners default to core.autocrlf=true. A CRLF checkout gives
# bin/*.mjs a "#!/usr/bin/env node\r" shebang, which Node's ESM loader rejects
# with "SyntaxError: Invalid or unexpected token" - reproduced locally by
# converting packages/crewcode-plugin-cli/bin/crewcode.mjs to CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never line-ending-convert binary assets. build/ icons ship inside the
# packaged app, so a corrupted byte here is a corrupted app icon.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.7z binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.tsbuildinfo binary
